Bundled in this repository
--------------------------
site/vendor/maplibre-gl.js, site/vendor/maplibre-gl.css
    MapLibre GL JS — BSD-3-Clause.
    https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-gl-js

site/vendor/pmtiles.js
    PMTiles (Protomaps) — BSD-3-Clause.
    https://github.com/protomaps/PMTiles

Produced by the build, not in this repository
---------------------------------------------
site/tiles/*.pmtiles, site/search/*.bin
    Derived from OpenStreetMap data, © OpenStreetMap contributors, licensed
    under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0. Any distribution of these
    tiles or of a database derived from them carries ODbL obligations,
    including attribution and share-alike. The rendered map attributes
    OpenStreetMap on screen; that attribution is a licence condition, not
    decoration. https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

site/boundaries.pmtiles
    Derived from Natural Earth (coastline, boundaries, state lines, lakes),
    which is in the public domain. https://www.naturalearthdata.com

site/fonts/
    Noto Sans glyph ranges from openmaptiles/fonts — SIL Open Font License 1.1.
    https://github.com/openmaptiles/fonts

Note that copying site/index.html alone still carries the MapLibre and PMTiles
terms, because the page loads those vendored files.
